<title>UK: Vodafone names new chief for Australian arm.</title>
<headline>Vodafone names new chief for Australian arm.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Vodafone Group Plc said it has appointed John Peett as chief executive of Vodafone Australia Pty Ltd.</p>
<p>Peett, who is also an executive director of Vodafone Group, will take up his job on November 1.</p>
<p>Vodafone was awarded a digital cellular network licence in Australia in 1992 and now has 220,000 subscribers using the network.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
